        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 8\" x 16\" Stainless Steel Door Push Plate</b>\r\n<p>\r\nExtra wide stainless push plate.  8\" wide x 16\" high commercial door push plate. Primarily used in restaurants, warehouses and factories these wide push plates are made of .050\" thick, high quality solid stainless steel for longevity. Packaged with stainless mounting screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4-x-16-stainless-steel-push-plate\"><b>Stainless Steel 4\" x 16\" Push Plate</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/6-x-16-stainless-steel-push-plate\"><b>Stainless Steel 6\" x 16\" Push Plate</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/8-x-16-polished-brass-push-plate\"><b>8\" x 16\" Polished Brass Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese extra wide commercial push plates are made in the USA by Don-Jo Mfg.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Don-Jo 73-630 Stainless Steel Push Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material:  Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
